 "lines": "In silent resounds— / choir chords / calm the nerves / of things I can't control / & offer them / as keepsakes back to the / higher powers. / Exhausted emotions / carry forward / a diminishing flame / to emit jazz-tuned / lyrics / that heat / & dry / the morning dew / on the remnants of / the destruction / revealed / in the sunlight.",
